    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How does he still have enough strength left for Arts?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could one find salvation alone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, not salvation, but a life with dignity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You come before me because of your sense of justice, and I arrived here because of mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It comes to myth, to obsession, to the ultimately futile crossing... the path was always beneath my feet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do we place our hopes on salvation? What we have done is not for the sake of salvation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But to save ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you come to your senses, Andoain? Then look me in the eye\u2014I felt like I was shooting a target dummy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll walk my own path, whether this is my mission or not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must thank you, Fiammetta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're welcome. I'll be sure to tell your friends about this epiphany at your funeral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for right now, you're\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid it's not yet time for that. I still have a use for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
