        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone blew up one of the support beams. We need to go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who the\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#4$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The explosion was approved. I personally submitted the application and stamped it myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oren! Why you\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing, Oren? Is this what you came to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welp, cat's out of the bag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Go, Andoain. I'll find you later.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fiammetta, Mostima... perhaps we'll meet again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wheresoever that may be, let us hold onto our obsessions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For as you say, they are why we exist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
