    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_222"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must be joking! What is wrong with Laterano's crisis management? That explosion damaged my collection! I demand an explanation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_165"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Lateran bells are ringing for the first time in a thousand years? Was this prepared by His Holiness as a special welcome for us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Impatient Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "Being with you barbarians is too much to bear. If not for my respect for His Holiness, I'd\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hesitant Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell the cook to prepare dinner. I refuse to attend another Lateran banquet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elegant Ambassador"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_356_1#9$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can these people really bring change? Most of them are opportunists, at best.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. This is something that only Laterano can do - Laterano, the city of miracles, forever fair and just.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Holiness... I will pray for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rare to see you so nervous, Velliv.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm too old for parlor tricks. All I can do is to keep walking, as far as I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Holiness, the broadcast is ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let my words and deeds honor my name and title.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
